{
  "id": 10056958312748,
  "title": "Evoworks Evo75 Aluminum Hotswap Wireless Keyboard",
  "body_html": "<ul style=\"padding-left: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;\" id=\"mkv3_bullets\">\n<li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth and 2.4 GHz</li>\n<li>CNC 6063 aluminum case with a ball-catch quick release design for a fast and toolless disassembly</li>\n<li>Butterfly leaf spring mount with silicone gaskets and cushions</li>\n<li>Physical toggle next to USB port allows for easy switch between connection modes</li>\n<li>South facing RGB LED</li>\n<li>1.2mm flex cut Hotswap PCB with NKRO</li>\n<li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li>\n<li>Programmable with QMK / VIA</li>\n<li>1.7mm thick Dye Sub PBT keycaps</li>\n<li>Compatible with Windows, Mac, and Linux</li>\n<li>8\u00b0 typing angle with PVD stainless steel external weight (weight color may vary among case colors)</li>\n<li>2* 4000mAh batteries</li>\n</ul><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\" id=\"mkv3_description\">Qwertykeys and Neo Studio are renowned for their industry-leading craftsmanship, and Ticktype Evoworks shares the same commitment to excellence. The new EVO75 keyboard builds on the beloved sleek rounded profile of its predecessor, the EVO80, while elevating the design to new heights of sophistication.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPolypropylene plate option comes with Rye switches. <br>\r\nFR4 plate option comes with Amber switches.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAnodized frame:<br>\r\n - Basalt Grey (Dark Grey)<br>\r\n - Tyrian (Purple)<br>\r\n - Ice Blue<br>\r\n - First Light<br>\r\n - Light Sage (Sage)<br>\r\n - Sand Gold<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSpray-coated frame:<br>\r\n - Nebula (Black)<br>\r\n - Baby Pink (Light Pink)<br>\r\n - Eclipse Grey (Grey)<br>\r\n - Nova White (White)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRenders are for reference only. Actual product colors may vary.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIncludes:<br>\r\n- carrying case<br>\r\n- keyboard pouch<br>\r\n- accessory bag<br>\r\n- user manual<br>\r\n- 2.4GHz receiver<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFree gifts (As per Qwertykey's policy, if any of these gifts are missing or damaged, they will not be re-shipped or replaced):<br>\r\n- USB-C to USB-A cable<br>\r\n- keycap / switch puller<br>\r\n- 3* spare switches<br>\r\n- dust cover<br>\r\n- 2* leaf spring silocone<br>\r\n- 2* gasket strips<br>\r\n- 3* Mac keycaps</div>\n\n<br><br><div style=\"max-width: 600px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n      <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HVaCFN1bvvc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<br><br><div style=\"max-width: 600px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n      <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nhN4Q2sDq4I\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n    </div>\n</div><br><br>",
